  <content>
  <section><para dir="ltr">The scatter plot below shows the results of a survey of eighth-grade students who were asked to report the number of hours per week they spend playing video games and the typical number of hours they sleep each night.</para>
<para dir="ltr"><figure><media alt="A SCATTER PLOT THAT SHOWS VIDEO GAME TIME IN HOURS PER WEEK ON THE X-AXIS AND SLEEP TIME IN HOURS PER NIGHT ON THE Y-AXIS. THE LINE DRAWN DECREASES FROM LEFT TO RIGHT."><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/82981ad7e626444b3c9f8331825d84f048b6b797"/></media></figure></para>
<para dir="ltr">Which of the following conclusions can you make looking at the data?</para></section>
</content>
